{"id": "81f008e8-b0a4-445f-8aca-d45fabd0cbb2", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T12:55:34.239839", "source": "user", "parent_id": "0ef14e9c-5af2-44a6-bdd9-fc7c1c1b7d7e", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"Привет. Сначала осмотри рабочую директорию /workspace и окружение, проверь доступные вводные материалы. Затем набросай предлагаемый подход к дизайну эксперимента (как будем исследовать динамику взаимодействия силы атаки, устойчивости защиты и комбинаций трюков на ASR для токенных атак AutoDAN и промпт-атак PAIR), а также укажи ключевые допущения и неопределенности. Полное решение и финальный дизайн пока не выкатывай — сначала согласуем план.\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"How do combined jailbreak techniques—involving attacker strength, defense strength, and previously tested tricks—affect the Attack Success Rate (ASR) of LLMs under both token-level (AutoDAN) and prompt-level (PAIR) attacks? What are the interaction dynamics between attacker power and defense robustness across datasets and attack styles?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [\"neurips2024/97431/11:setup_17\", \"neurips2024/97431/11:setup_18\"], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "act